This dataset presents the supporting notes for the UK species reports  *often known as an audit trail for each habitat. This helps to explain how the data in the species reports were derived and any caveats that are required. This audit trail includes a range of  parameters for each species as described in the UK Approach Document. 
http://jncc.defra.gov.uk/pdf/A17_2013_UKApproach.pdf  
 there is a separate row of data for each combination of species and attribute/parameter.
These notes were deemed necessary to collate because the EC reporting format did not allow for the submission of substantial details as regards the underlying information sources and reasoning used in the production of the UK reports.

